A '''sulfur pool''' is a upcoming [[feature]] of [[sulfur caves]].

== Description ==
Sulfur pools consist of a body of [[water]] surrounded by [[sulfur]] blocks and contains [[potent sulfur]] at the bottom. Potent sulfur creates bubbles and yellow particles which inflict the [[Nausea]] effect for 3 seconds when entering.

